641		/**
642		 * Delivers a success response's result. A null or missing result reads as {@code {}}
643		 * for a {@link AcpSchema.DefaultOnNull} response type, completes empty for an
644		 * extension ({@code _}-prefixed) method, whose result may legally be null, and
645		 * otherwise fails the request. A result that cannot be read as the type, or lacks a
646		 * field the schema requires, fails the request too. Each failure is an {@link AcpError}
